\n・派手な衣装(高いハイヒール、露出の高い服装、豹柄)\n\n・ファー系の衣装(レッグファーやファーコート)\n等の要素があると嬉しいです。\n\n以上がリクエストになります。\nあくまで理想なのでじゃーまん様の描きやすい、描きたいイラストに変更追加なさっていただいて結構です。\nじゃーまん様のイラスト大好きなので描いて頂けるととても嬉しいです。宜しくお願いいたします", "nc": 160, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 43569, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "りよ☕️", "screen_name": "Liyocafe", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1910203683641647105/rB76lrWj.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/969535290636361728/1761772775/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 49}, {"id": 253293, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "旧・外道男爵", "screen_name": "HidouGe", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1663033841152581648/DFvHECkL.jpg", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 161}, {"id": 257605, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "豹紋院ござる", "screen_name": "ikidumi", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2041525497797206016/tiNr39Ku.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/921023465360039941/1690097248/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 100, "